### FilmFuse core-api - ratings feed and likes. Token: see me.http.
# Visibility (one rule, rating.repository.RatingVisibilitySql): never calibration swipes; never across
# a block (either way) or from a suspended author; PUBLIC to anyone, FRIENDS to the author's friends
# and the author, PRIVATE only on the author's own /users/{self}/ratings.
# Every list: 20 per page, newest updatedAt first (re-rating moves an item up); pass nextCursor as ?cursor=.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@movieId = 603
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@ratingId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Friends feed: my and my friends' visible ratings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/feed?scope=FRIENDS
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Everyone feed: visible PUBLIC ratings by anyone
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/feed?scope=EVERYONE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A movie's ratings (same scopes; 404 for a movie that is not cached)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/{{movieId}}/ratings?scope=FRIENDS
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A user's ratings I can see (my own id: everything but swipes, PRIVATE included). 404 if blocked either way
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Like (204, idempotent; 404 if I cannot see the rating)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ratings/{{ratingId}}/like
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unlike (204, idempotent)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ratings/{{ratingId}}/like
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing or unknown scope -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/feed?scope=ALL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
